{# W3C SCXML G.7: <sce:action> native host dispatch. The call site (including
   the typed `_event.data` tag check when the action reads a payload field) is
   lowered ahead of the template by `forge::native_action::render` and stored
   on `action.native_action_rendered`, so this template only emits it — the
   same division of labour the Rust sibling uses, and the reason one lowering
   serves six backends. No script engine is involved. #}
		// W3C SCXML G.7: <sce:action name="{{ action.native_action_name }}">
		{{ action.native_action_rendered }}
